meta {
  name: Download ASH feedback
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forms/ash/download/ashfeedback
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Download ASH Program Feedback (CSV Export)
  
  Exports the entire `ash_program_feedback` table as a CSV file download. Selects all rows from the table (no filters, no pagination) and converts them to CSV using `json2csv` in the controller layer. The response is sent directly as a `text/csv` attachment — this endpoint does **not** return JSON.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires authentication (`authenticate()`) and `"read"` permission (`authorize("read")`).
  
  ## Request
  No path parameters, query parameters, or request body.
  
  ## Response — `200 OK`
  
  **Content-Type:** `text/csv`
  **Content-Disposition:** `attachment; filename="ash_program_feedback.csv"`
  
  The CSV contains one row per feedback submission with the following columns (in order):
  
  | Column | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `id` | UUID primary key |
  | `studentFirstName` | Student's first name |
  | `studentSurname` | Student's surname |
  | `schoolName` | Name of school attended |
  | `currentClass` | Student's current class level |
  | `attendanceFrequency` | How frequently the student attended sessions |
  | `enjoyedParts` | Parts of the programme the student enjoyed |
  | `learningImprovementRating` | Student's rating of learning improvement |
  | `confidenceRating` | Student's confidence rating |
  | `volunteerSupportRating` | Student's rating of volunteer support |
  | `studentEnjoyedMost` | What the student enjoyed most |
  | `studentImprovementSuggestions` | Student's suggestions for improvement |
  | `parentGuardianName` | Parent/guardian full name |
  | `parentGuardianRelationship` | Parent/guardian relationship to student |
  | `parentPhone` | Parent/guardian phone number |
  | `childBenefited` | Whether the parent believes the child benefited |
  | `academicImprovementNoticed` | Whether the parent noticed academic improvement |
  | `confidenceBehaviorChange` | Whether the parent noticed confidence/behavior changes |
  | `mostValuableAspects` | Most valuable aspects according to the parent |
  | `parentSatisfactionRating` | Parent's overall satisfaction rating |
  | `programImpactOnChild` | Parent's assessment of programme impact on child |
  | `parentImprovementSuggestions` | Parent's suggestions for improvement |
  | `additionalComments` | Any additional comments |
  | `updatedAt` | Last update timestamp |
  | `createdAt` | Creation timestamp |
  | `deletedAt` | Soft-delete timestamp (null if active) |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized` | Missing or invalid access token / refresh token. |
  | `403 Forbidden` | User lacks the `"read"` permission. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error. |
}
